# Mobile + deploy pipeline

- Cloud Agent work on **`cursor/*`** with PR to **`develop`**.
- Auto-merge after CI → **Deploy HostGator** + **Deploy GitHub Pages**.
- Bump `CACHE` / `SDF_BUILD` / `?v=` (`b002`…) on visible ships.
- Never commit secrets or the private game recipe.
- HostGator package must not overwrite live `data/*.json`.
- Production HostGator path: `/spirit/` (https://jhonatanribeiro.com/spirit/).
- See `AGENTS.md` and `docs/MOBILE-AUTO-PROD.md`.
